# DS-0002 "Specify at least 1 USER command with non-root user":
# Running Mosquitto as root is a DELIBERATE, documented decision (see
# run.sh header): TLS keys and the ACL file are 600 root:root and the
# add-on data dir is root-owned — a privilege drop would break persistence
# and file access. The official HA Mosquitto add-on runs as root for the
# same reason.
AVD-DS-0002
